        {
          "text": "Tuondoke, tupande kwenda Betheli, nami nitamfanyia Mungu madhabahu huko; yeye aliyenisikia siku ya shida yangu, akawa pamoja nami katika njia yote niliyoiendea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
